  {
   "id": "warm-snow-167432@major-2023-12-05",
   "gameId": "warm-snow-167432",
   "displayName": "【DLC2 Update】Boss Difficulty Optimization, Talisman System Guide, Bug Fixes!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-12-05T10:19:58.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Version: 3.0.0.1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Experience Optimization",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Reduced the damage dealt by the boss \"Immortal Wolf\" in the initial difficulty level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Reduced the damage dealt by the mini-boss \"Qingyi\" in the initial difficulty level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Reduced the Health of the mini-boss \"Qingyi\" for all difficulty level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Added a guide for the 10 talent points received as a gift from the \"Heart of All Things\"(The Talisman System).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. The universal skill \"Sleeping Arhat\" will no longer attack when not in combat.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. The health bar for the boss \"Heluo Egg's Flesh Root\" will now be displayed by default.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed an issue where the talisman \"Instant Death\" could cause monsters to be unkillable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fixed an issue where resurrection could occur outside the base.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Fixed an issue where being killed by monsters while loading would result in immediate death upon entering a new map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Fixed an issue where the trial \"Chaotic reality\" did not randomly generate the player's relics after defeating the boss \"Mysterious Sea Beast\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Fixed an issue where the trial \"boar's return\" did not drop random relics.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Added an opening effect to the transition screen between levels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Fixed an issue where attacks from certain monsters had a chance to cause the player to slide.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. Fixed an issue where the boss in Chapter 1 had a chance to drop items outside the map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. Fixed some text errors.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "————",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
