       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed the problem that quitting the game would cause refine attributes loss.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fixed the problem of stuck that relic[Ink Fire Crystal]and [Black Powder] caused.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Fixed the problem that Soul Blacksmith would upgrade your sword after you quit the upgrade interface with gamepad.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Fixed the problem that the game setting unexpected change or the game unexpected quit when you leave the Soul Blacksmith with gamepad.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Fixed the problem that standing on the product and opening the pause interface will cause the product introduction disappear.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
